description: TanStack Router file-based routes and generated route tree handling
globs:
  - src/app/routes/**/*.tsx
  - src/app/router.tsx
  - src/routeTree.gen.ts
alwaysApply: false
---
# Routing

- Keep route definitions in file-based route modules under `src/app/routes/`.
- Treat `src/routeTree.gen.ts` as generated output; never edit it manually.
- Put route-specific redirects, loaders, search validation, and auth gating in the route module that owns the path.
- Move bulky view logic into feature components; routes should compose features rather than reimplementing them.
